                        "source_sense_id": "e8a710d0-bd5a-33b3-8a65-202f01c99e2f",
                        "target_lang_word": "nervenkrank",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nervenkrank",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01a31c5c-6667-38b5-ac0b-3f715628086f",
                                        "entry_id": "487800cd-4ae3-3b75-b486-84b99f739603",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "an einer psychischen Krankheit leidend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "outdated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65182f83-6a19-4929-a7ba-6568aa948bd5",
                                                "sense_id": "01a31c5c-6667-38b5-ac0b-3f715628086f",
                                                "text": "„Unser Museum war ein gotteslästerlicher, unvorstellbarer Ort, an dem wir mit dem satanischen Geschmack nervenkranker Virtuosen einen Kosmos des Grauens und Verfalls arrangiert hatten, um unsere abgestumpften Sinne zu erregen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07d5efdf-8b6f-4d79-95a9-111c1d7dc0b0",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d0ae04c-e055-3b76-99c1-a6090adb38c1",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8a710d0-bd5a-33b3-8a65-202f01c99e2f",
                        "target_lang_word": "neurotic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "neurotic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e14399c-ad90-32ef-a1ac-5a1b3cc85228",
                                        "entry_id": "f0d06d75-9359-3cb5-b08e-910bb3777edc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Affected with a neurosis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45d3370b-5c11-40f3-8e8e-1405fa95cb7d",
                                                "sense_id": "0e14399c-ad90-32ef-a1ac-5a1b3cc85228",
                                                "text": "If there were such a thing as inspiration from a higher realm, it might well be that the neurotic temperament would furnish the chief condition of the requisite receptivity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cee4b3af-b6d6-3924-b9a3-a3c4f3d1fc81",
                                        "entry_id": "f0d06d75-9359-3cb5-b08e-910bb3777edc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Overly anxious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f1edc2a-2160-4e5e-a3e2-55a840e06159",
                                                "sense_id": "cee4b3af-b6d6-3924-b9a3-a3c4f3d1fc81",
                                                "text": "He is getting neurotic about time-keeping."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7ada65e-4d13-4587-b2da-cb9c64394a06",
                                                "sense_id": "cee4b3af-b6d6-3924-b9a3-a3c4f3d1fc81",
                                                "text": "“I don't mean all of your friends—only a small proportion—which, however, connects your circle with that deadly, idle, brainless bunch—the insolent chatterers at the opera, the gorged dowagers, the worn-out, passionless men,[…], the speed-mad fugitives from the furies of ennui, the neurotic victims of mental cirrhosis,[…]!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a2a1df2-f3ff-4d01-87b3-20bd0d962dd0",
                                                "sense_id": "cee4b3af-b6d6-3924-b9a3-a3c4f3d1fc81",
                                                "text": "“You did come down a wallop, didn't you? How art thou fallen from heaven, oh Lucifer, son of the morning, I said to myself. You're so terribly neurotic, Bertie. You must try to be less jumpy. What you need is a good nerve tonic.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4809abb0-05c2-3289-89b2-c6566f7a0210",
                                        "entry_id": "f0d06d75-9359-3cb5-b08e-910bb3777edc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Useful in disorders of, or affecting, the nerves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "neurotic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9cf7508b-6506-32fa-b185-85a68db4be36",
                                        "entry_id": "85fe07bd-c171-3ba1-a4a3-5093133ab952",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who has a neurosis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17723cb8-4a60-3bde-9b84-7480b0636291",
                                        "entry_id": "85fe07bd-c171-3ba1-a4a3-5093133ab952",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A crazy person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9706d1a-63fc-450e-8983-8723c31c8c7c",
                                                "sense_id": "17723cb8-4a60-3bde-9b84-7480b0636291",
                                                "text": "Drag this neurotic to hysterics, leave him balked and unfulfilled;\nholding inside, outwardly patient 'til the time he'll call it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14bb6db1-d37f-4e90-8e74-0ae018dbb3de",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d0ae04c-e055-3b76-99c1-a6090adb38c1",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8a710d0-bd5a-33b3-8a65-202f01c99e2f",
                        "target_lang_word": "névropathe",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "névropathe",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff0e0bf2-5706-35db-bccc-cc508de4bc3a",
                                        "entry_id": "07203222-cb08-3065-9230-be16ff0d0384",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Névrotique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c0f8c8b-4ec7-494f-9161-5d69f26e7c38",
                                                "sense_id": "ff0e0bf2-5706-35db-bccc-cc508de4bc3a",
                                                "text": "Cette constatation faite, nous n'en avons pas moins à compter avec la nombreuse cohorte des névropathes vraiment insomniaques, qui souffrent de ne pas dormir, et qui prient instamment que le sommeil leur soit rendu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a96fc29-88b9-4d56-94c4-3ea7be96f46e",
                                                "sense_id": "ff0e0bf2-5706-35db-bccc-cc508de4bc3a",
                                                "text": "Il se mettait à sangloter. Il ne voulait même pas savoir pourquoi, s’essuyait les yeux, se disait en riant: « C’est charmant, je deviens névropathe »."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "627e4f52-9d6d-4b50-a967-ef618e14a9cb",
                                                "sense_id": "ff0e0bf2-5706-35db-bccc-cc508de4bc3a",
                                                "text": "Depuis lors elle eut toute une série de phobies, de toutes sortes, qui se dissipèrent au bout de plusieurs années seulement, en la laissant encore très névropathe et impressionnable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "névropathe",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b65e645f-aebe-33ef-b723-6491d4c10739",
                                        "entry_id": "98dcb2fe-76fd-3874-8fee-d09e3c16a80f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Névrosé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5eb4cc9a-0636-4607-a53a-6f654738cb3a",
                                                "sense_id": "b65e645f-aebe-33ef-b723-6491d4c10739",
                                                "text": "Un névropathe adulte, qui ne sais pas ce qu'est l’onanisme buccal ou la friquarelle (cela arrive), ne fait jamais mention de ces perversions dans son autoanalyse, quelque loin qu'elle soit poussée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c49b126b-3711-457b-abe0-fef659cfb087",
                                                "sense_id": "b65e645f-aebe-33ef-b723-6491d4c10739",
                                                "text": "Il est clair par exemple qu'il est difficile de faire suivre un régime alimentaire à un névropathe à la table de famille et que cela est plus facile quand il vit séparément."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
